// RESEARCH DIAGNOSTIC ONLY.
//
// This variant keeps the v0.4 multi-resolution construction and adds a local
// paired-node test. Every retained boundary keeps the direction of its dense
// side. Starting at that anchor, each grid scans outward on the dense side and
// accepts the nearest material local maximum in opposite-direction clean
// strength that encloses a local volume bulge. The local-maximum test prevents
// tiny ripples inside one transition from becoming edges. A width cap prevents
// a local edge from swallowing a broad composite distribution. A node is drawn
// only when the base-grid pair is complete and at least one neighboring grid
// agrees on direction and both endpoints.
//
//   fine   = round(base row ticks * 0.8)
//   base   = base row ticks
//   coarse = round(base row ticks * 1.2)
//
// Each profile allocates every source bar's total volume by exact high/low tick
// overlap. The existing provisional local log-jump gates are applied to each
// grid independently. Anchor clustering keeps its configurable radius, while
// mate endpoints use the stricter fixed radius of one base row. Neighbor grids
// are evaluated pair-aware instead of inheriting the preselected standalone
// neighbor. Stable pairs rank by grid support, worst cross-grid node prominence,
// then the minimum anchor z score. Unpaired consensus anchors remain eligible
// as standalones. A selected pair consumes consensus anchors inside the node or
// within one consensus radius of either edge.
//
// Optional structural bounds can suppress otherwise-valid consensus shelves
// that are too close to the RSD range low or high. They are suppression inputs,
// not additional evidence.
//
// Endpoint contract:
//   [Start 15m bar time, End 15m bar time + 15 minutes)
//
// This script does not create entries, exits, or support/resistance claims.
// It tests whether both edges of a volume node survive row-size perturbation.
indicator(
     "VP RSD Local Node Edge Consensus Diagnostic v0.5.1",
     shorttitle = "VP RSD LOCAL 0.5.1",
     overlay = true,
     max_bars_back = 5000,
     max_lines_count = 500,
     max_boxes_count = 10,
     max_labels_count = 100)


// ============================================================================
// INPUTS
// ============================================================================

